  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dar es Salaam Integrated Waste project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A primary MSW management system for a large metropolitan area as Dar es Salaam, in Tanzania&#x2019;s current development phase, must be solid and scalable. The urgency demands a strong public dominance and it must be focused on sustainable operations with regard to financials and organizations. The overall work on this solid waste management &#x201c;backbone&#x201d; can be subdivided into seven work packages. Along with this programme come two additional work packages on involving the Dutch waste management industry where useful and appropriate and on overall programme coordination.</narrative>
  </description>
